Z||000016||Joe Torma||12-23-2001||12:41 AM||||I can output up to 11x17 on my Fiery laser printers  I can also laminate/mount them too.<P>Not exactly poster size, but for $1.00~$1.50 a page you can't exactly go wrong. Add $1.25 to laminate(mounted slightly more). <P>If you are interested, send me a pdf, zipped TIFF or JPEG, or mail me a photo.  NOTE if you have taken digital pictures, they should be HIGH resolution for a quality output.<P>I can have larger made, but you should contact MinnGreen, he should have dibs on that.<P>------------------<BR>Its never going to be finished...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig2_2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 12-23-2001).]||||reg||1
