Z||000054||MinnGreenGT||12-27-2001||10:19 AM||||OK... the LT1 Choptop poster is 9.5" tall x 24" wide (cause that's all the bigger I could blow up the photo) but did spend a ton of time in Photoshop cleaning & fixing stuff too.  And they'll be $20 each- mailed.<P>But I do need LT1 Choptop's permission to sell them (and LT1 Choptop will get his free if he lets me sell them to other people  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)?<P>I also ran a test print on Skitime's poster last night. I've still got a little "fine tuning" to do on the color, but the largest I could get his was 24"wide x 20"tall (24"x36" just destroyed the quality too much- 24x20 is already stretching it a bit).<P>Randy- I can make one for your rally car, but you'll have to either get a high resolution scan (400-600 pix/in @ 4x6 photo) or send me the photo to scan. The better quality the picture, the better (if it looks a little blurry on your 4x6 print- it'll be more blurry at 2'x3')  If you want it to look like LT1Choptop's (removed background, etc) that will run extra (probably another $25-35 depending on what needs to be done).<P>Cost for custom posters will be: <BR>$50 for a "Full-Size" 2'x3' poster <BR>$40 for a "3/4 size" 2'x1.5' (approx Skitime's Size)<BR>$20 for a "Small" 9.5"x24" (LT1ChopTop's Size)<BR>and any poster can be laminated for $10.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/posters01.jpg"> <BR><FONT SIZE="1">And if more than 10 people order any poster, a discount will apply! ($25 for skitime's in this size ...if he wants me to sell them).</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000055||MinnGreenGT||12-27-2001||05:57 PM||||Well... LT1 Choptop has given me the "go ahead" to sell/market posters of his car!<P>Now... who wants one?  Payment-wise checks & money orders are the best way to go (these will be sold through my company, not me personally).<P>Skitime gets to decide whether or not he'd like to market his posters himself... or have me do it (I'm game either way).  So for the moment- it's specifically LT1 Choptop and custom posters.  OK?<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000056||85 gt fiero||12-27-2001||08:40 PM||||pm me your address and ill send you some better pics.  thanx<P>------------------<BR>17 YEAR OLD WITH A RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES, LIGHT BARS, SCS SUSPENSION, KONI ADJUSTERS,HIGH POINT CUTOFFS,||||reg||1
